# Override for staging: https://mystaging.distributedsource.com
DS_BASE_URL=https://my.distributedsource.com
DS_HISTORY_BASE_URL=https://full-history.anywhere.co/live-read

# Tagging step (src/tag/tag-task.ts). Read directly by the AI SDK's OpenAI provider.
